    </marc:datafield>
    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Tsetse-transmitted animal trypanosomiasis is a complex disease that directly and indirectly has an impact on Africa&apos;s crop and livestock agricultural development. In this paper, state-of-the-art spatial tools are applied to study the variety of agro-ecological settings in West Africa with a view to providing decision support to the management of the tsetse and trypanosomiasis problem according to the prevailing agro-ecological conditions.</marc:subfield>
